#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:53
msgid "候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT"
msgstr "Clean Candidate Structures Before DFT"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:53
msgid "从训练误差定位下一轮数据缺口"
msgstr "Find the next data gap from training errors"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:53
msgid "组织多轮数据和模型版本"
msgstr "Manage data and model versions across iterations"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:53
msgid "命令行与脚本运行工作流"
msgstr "Run Workflows from the Command Line or a Script"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:2 ef14e3ca8a3c4811b2df93edb4cd9fee
msgid "工作流"
msgstr "Workflows"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:4 c3e1509f024d41b88f7d330fc32505e3
msgid "这里的页面按真实任务组织，而不是按按钮组织。按钮细节可以查模块参考；工作流页只回答： 数据从哪里来，在哪一步该判断什么，最后输出给谁。"
msgstr ""
"These pages are organized by real tasks rather than toolbar buttons. Use "
"the module reference for individual controls; use workflow pages to "
"understand where data comes from, what to decide at each stage, and where"
" the result goes next."

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:7 cb354189294d4a2a842be8d237e5e85a
msgid "三条工作流分别对应“训练前、训练后和跨轮次管理”："
msgstr ""
"The three workflows cover work before training, work after training, and "
"management across iterations:"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:12 5b1ad878153a4ed9b9d7edd410430e8b
msgid "训练前：清洗候选结构"
msgstr "Before training: clean candidate structures"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:16 1bb24c020e89422690364d40edd69176
msgid ""
"已经生成候选池，但还没有送 DFT。先排除明显坏结构，再选择代表样本。 输出通常是 ``candidate_pool_clean.xyz`` "
"或待标注子集。"
msgstr ""
"You already have a candidate pool, but it has not gone to DFT. Remove "
"clearly bad structures first, then select representative samples. The "
"output is usually ``candidate_pool_clean.xyz`` or a subset ready for "
"labeling."

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:19 80c431c0792d4da7ad2779444281a106
msgid "训练后：从误差找缺口"
msgstr "After training: find gaps from errors"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:23 9a3dec3bb6fc4a1691b15257194f74fa
msgid "已经有训练／测试结果。把最大误差和异常点映射回结构，判断下一轮该补什么数据。 输出通常是复核结构集和下一轮生成目标。"
msgstr ""
"You already have training or test results. Map the largest errors and "
"outliers back to structures, then decide what data to add next. The "
"output is usually a review set and a target list for the next generation "
"round."

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:26 ccf3edaebefd455186d3a578ffa77af2
msgid "多轮迭代：管理版本"
msgstr "Across iterations: manage versions"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:30 6fcc30e7e9924213b540a46427e48f79
msgid "已经开始第二轮及以后。固定数据、模型和报告的对应关系，避免覆盖上一轮结果。 输出是可追溯的轮次目录和记录。"
msgstr ""
"You are starting the second iteration or later. Keep the relationships "
"between data, models, and reports fixed so that earlier results are not "
"overwritten. The output is a traceable iteration directory and record."

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:33 5c2796b763b94a08bc19ef05bce2da04
msgid "它们在完整流程中的关系是："
msgstr "Their relationship in the complete workflow is:"

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:35 105ae3f58f0a4d9d8928fe63c37a6aff
msgid ""
"生成候选结构\n"
"     │\n"
"     ▼\n"
"清洗候选结构 ──→ DFT 标注 ──→ GPUMD 训练\n"
"                                   │\n"
"                                   ▼\n"
"                           从训练误差定位缺口\n"
"                                   │\n"
"                                   └──→ 下一轮候选结构\n"
"\n"
"“组织多轮数据和模型版本”贯穿每一轮，记录输入、输出和模型对应关系。"
msgstr ""
"Generate candidate structures\n"
"     │\n"
"     ▼\n"
"Clean candidate structures ──→ DFT labeling ──→ GPUMD training\n"
"                                   │\n"
"                                   ▼\n"
"                           Find gaps from training errors\n"
"                                   │\n"
"                                   └──→ Next-round candidate structures\n"
"\n"
"“Manage data and model versions across iterations” applies to every round"
" and records the relationships between inputs, outputs, and models."

#: ../../source/workflows/index.rst:49 2d4d257cf105484c80dd1472cc3b0d45
msgid ""
"如果你只是看不懂某个按钮或参数，不必从工作流开始，直接进入 :doc:`../module/index`。 "
"如果你要完成一次具体的单步操作，例如能量平移或按索引选结构，进入 :doc:`../example/index`。"
msgstr ""
"If you only need help with a button or parameter, do not start with a "
"workflow; open :doc:`../module/index`. If you need to complete a specific"
" one-step task, such as shifting energies or selecting structures by "
"index, open :doc:`../example/index`."
